description	"First Order Survivor

A battle-worn stormtrooper relying on dual auto-pistols, high mobility, and pure grit.

^2Weaponry:
- Melee
- Dual SE-44C Auto Pistols (3)
-- Clone Pistols
-- 25%- Damage/FP Drain
-- 20%+ RoF
-- Mag Reload
- Concussion Grenade (1)

^8Attributes:
- Reinforcement (1)
- Blast Armor
- Getups (3)
- Dexterity (1)
- Slow Faller
- Bunny Hop (0)
- Sense Immunity
- Grapple Hop
- Assemble (1)
- Anti MT (1)
- Knockdown Roll
- 40% Slower Skill Cooldowns

^3Abilities:
- Wrist Laser ^3[CS1]
-- Cripples On Hit, 50% Less Damage
- Dash (1) ^3[CS2]
- Dex Roll ^3[CS3]
- Grapple Hook (2) ^3[CS4 Melee]
- Gunkick ^3[CS4]"